[I] Administration shell for storage targets

[T] targetcli-fb is a command shell for managing the Linux LIO kernel
[T] target. It is used to configure iSCSI, FCoE and other SCSI targets using
[T] the TCM/LIO kernel target subsystem.

[U] https://github.com/open-iscsi/targetcli-fb

[A] Targetcli Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

